<header class="page-head">
  <span class="page-kicker">Mini Game</span>
  <h1>Bee Ballistics 🐝</h1>
  <p>Tembakkan lebah ke kepiting yang mengambang. Kamu hanya boleh mengatur <strong>kecepatan awal</strong> dan <strong>sudut elevasi</strong> — sisanya diurus oleh gravitasi. Karang dan batu menghalangi jalan, jadi hitung dulu sebelum menembak.</p>
</header>

<section class="fade-in">
  <div class="panel">
    <div class="panel-head">
      <span id="statusLine">Memuat peta…</span>
    </div>
    <div class="panel-body game-body">

      <div class="canvas-wrap">
        <canvas id="field" aria-label="Lapangan tembak dengan sumbu koordinat"></canvas>
      </div>

      <div class="controls">
        <div class="ctrl">
          <label for="vel">Kecepatan awal <b>v₀</b> <span class="unit">m/s</span></label>
          <div class="ctrl-row">
            <input type="range" id="velRange" min="10" max="60" step="0.5" value="35">
            <input type="number" id="vel" min="10" max="60" step="0.5" value="35">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ctrl">
          <label for="ang">Sudut elevasi <b>θ</b> <span class="unit">derajat</span></label>
          <div class="ctrl-row">
            <input type="range" id="angRange" min="1" max="89" step="0.5" value="45">
            <input type="number" id="ang" min="1" max="89" step="0.5" value="45">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="game-actions">
          <button id="fireBtn" class="btn game-btn">Tembak 🐝</button>
          <button id="newBtn" class="btn-line">Peta Baru</button>
          <button id="hintBtn" class="btn-line">Petunjuk</button>
          <button id="clearBtn" class="btn-line">Hapus Jejak</button>
        </div>

        <div class="diff-row">
